</section>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.5 </span>Parameter Summaries</h3>

<div id="A1.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Here we plot parameter summaries for trained Bellman-Ford models from <a href="#S5" title="5 Case Study: Bellman-Ford ‣ MINAR: Mechanistic Interpretability for Neural Algorithmic Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Section</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> and <a href="#A1.SS3" title="A.3 Bellman-Ford without Self-Loops ‣ Appendix A Additional Results for Bellman-Ford ‣ MINAR: Mechanistic Interpretability for Neural Algorithmic Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Section</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.3</span></a>. For readability we only plot results from the mainline run.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.F18" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2602.21442v1/images/parameter_summaries/bellman_ford_params_seed_0.png" id="A1.F18.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/156;" width="476" height="156" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A1.F18.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 18</span>: </span><span id="A1.F18.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Parameter summary for Bellman-Ford MinAggGNN (<a href="#S5.SS2" title="5.2 The Bellman-Ford Circuit ‣ 5 Case Study: Bellman-Ford ‣ MINAR: Mechanistic Interpretability for Neural Algorithmic Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Section</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5.2</span></a>).</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A1.F19" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2602.21442v1/images/parameter_summaries/parallel_params.png" id="A1.F19.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/159;" width="476" height="159" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A1.F19.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 19</span>: </span><span id="A1.F19.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Parameter summary for parallel Bellman-Ford and BFS MinAggGNN (<a href="#S5.SS2" title="5.2 The Bellman-Ford Circuit ‣ 5 Case Study: Bellman-Ford ‣ MINAR: Mechanistic Interpretability for Neural Algorithmic Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Section</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5.2</span></a>).</span></figcaption>
</figure>
